  <!-- Isolation Barrier Compliance Notes -->
  (text "BIOMEDICAL ISOLATION BARRIER RULES:\n1. Minimum 4.0 mm physical creepage and clearance distance between GND_LOGIC and GND_ISO.\n2. No copper planes, traces, or vias allowed across the isolation moat.\n3. Patient leakage current verified < 2.0 uA under single-fault conditions (SFC)."
